{"id":"33292a1a991cbb70","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md","title":"算术层级","display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — 算术层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","aliases":["28-df-arithmetic-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — 算术层级","depends_on":["[[28-df-formula]]","[[28-df-satisfaction]]","[[28-df-free-variable]]","[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","[[28-df-atomic-formula]]","[[28-df-assignment]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-arithmetic-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — 算术层级"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d82c10f45e77e524\" href=\"?note=d82c10f45e77e524\" title=\"28-df-satisfaction\">28-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5167b1e044a694ca\" href=\"?note=5167b1e044a694ca\" title=\"28-df-free-variable\">28-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"34fa28c2966187ff\" href=\"?note=34fa28c2966187ff\" title=\"28-df-atomic-formula\">28-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arithmetic-hierarchy-—-算术层级-$\\Sigma_n^0,-\\Pi_n^0$\">df-arithmetic-hierarchy — 算术层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 的常元为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，一元函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，二元函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\times\">\\(+,\\times\\)</span>，二元关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>；标准结构为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N=(\\mathbb N,0,S,+,\\times,&lt;)\">\\(\\mathfrak N=(\\mathbb N,0,S,+,\\times,&lt;)\\)</span>。语法、满足与自由变量来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d82c10f45e77e524\" href=\"?note=d82c10f45e77e524\" title=\"28-df-satisfaction\">28-df-satisfaction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5167b1e044a694ca\" href=\"?note=5167b1e044a694ca\" title=\"28-df-free-variable\">28-df-free-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"34fa28c2966187ff\" href=\"?note=34fa28c2966187ff\" title=\"28-df-atomic-formula\">28-df-atomic-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{var}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\psi\">\\(\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\psi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\psi\">\\(\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\psi\\)</span> 为下式构造的有界量词语法缩写，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\psi\\)</span> 为下式定义的标准模型等价关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 为非空有限变量列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists()\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\psi,\\qquad\\forall()\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\psi,\\qquad\\exists(x,\\bar y)\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\exists x(\\exists\\bar y\\,\\psi),\\qquad\\forall(x,\\bar y)\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\forall x(\\forall\\bar y\\,\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists()\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\psi,\\qquad\\forall()\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\psi,\\qquad\\exists(x,\\bar y)\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\exists x(\\exists\\bar y\\,\\psi),\\qquad\\forall(x,\\bar y)\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\forall x(\\forall\\bar y\\,\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\psi),\\qquad\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\psi)\\quad(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists x&lt;t\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\psi),\\qquad\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\psi\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\psi)\\quad(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N)\\quad(\\mathfrak N\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N)\\quad(\\mathfrak N\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad D_{j+1}\\coloneqq D_j\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi,\\varphi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in D_j,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qx&lt;t\\,\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in D_j,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\ x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t),\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\quad D_{j+1}\\coloneqq D_j\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi,\\varphi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in D_j,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qx&lt;t\\,\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in D_j,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\ x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t),\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}D_j,\\quad\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0,\\quad\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_0^0\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}D_j,\\quad\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0,\\quad\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\Sigma_{n+1}^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\mid\\exists\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\;\\exists\\bar x\\in\\bigcup_{m\\ge1}\\mathrm{Var}^m\\;\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\exists\\bar x\\,\\psi\\},\\\\\\Pi_{n+1}^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\mid\\exists\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\;\\exists\\bar x\\in\\bigcup_{m\\ge1}\\mathrm{Var}^m\\;\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\forall\\bar x\\,\\psi\\},\\\\\\Delta_{n+1}^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\cap\\Pi_{n+1}^0.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\Sigma_{n+1}^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\mid\\exists\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\;\\exists\\bar x\\in\\bigcup_{m\\ge1}\\mathrm{Var}^m\\;\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\exists\\bar x\\,\\psi\\},\\\\\\Pi_{n+1}^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\mid\\exists\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\;\\exists\\bar x\\in\\bigcup_{m\\ge1}\\mathrm{Var}^m\\;\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\forall\\bar x\\,\\psi\\},\\\\\\Delta_{n+1}^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\cap\\Pi_{n+1}^0.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>修正基层只含无量词公式的错误，允许有界量词，并在高层按标准自然数结构中的等价式闭合。这样交集表达可同时为存在型和全称型的关系，而不是把互斥的首量词语法硬取交。此算术逻辑附录不充作原书多项式层级的定义；PH 的量词须带多项式长度界。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n<p>R7复核：补足本地逻辑附录的直接来源及按有限变量列递归的量词缩写；标准结构等价闭合与有界量词基层保持不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy-—-算术层级-$\\Sigma_n^0,-\\Pi_n^0$","text":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — 算术层级 $\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"li